/P 29 0 R
/E (Reflection \(Muhammad Aiman Hakimi bin Ahmad Yusoff \))
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 29 0 R
/E (The industry talk, which included a talk by Othman \(2026\), indicated that higher-order thinking skills \(HOTS\) are important for entering industry, because technical knowledge alone may not be sufficient. In particular, metacognition enables individuals to evaluate their reasoning and correct errors. Learning Java at matriculation level stimulated my interest in programming; therefore, I plan to develop expertise in computer science and data engineering over the next three years. In Years 1 and 2, I will establish foundations in programming, data structures, Structured Query Language \(SQL\), and Linux, and study cloud technologies for Amazon Web Services \(AWS\) certification. In Year 3, I will begin a 50-week industry internship, applying these skills and maintaining a learning journal to evaluate my thinking. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
