/E (In this talk, I learned that creative thinking is also one of the critical skills needed to be successful in computer science and data engineering fields. I will master high-performance code and databases, so I can solve complex problems more efficiently. I will also prove my problem-solving skills by building and showcasing course-related projects using all my knowledge and creative thinking skills that I have learned in this talk. I will train myself to solve problems quickly and accurately through hands-on experience. I believe that I can produce innovative solutions in the future by combining my technical skills with critical thinking.)
